; without new syntax a macro call takes no parameters without braces
; (BB2's rule): after OPTIMIZE 4 !pm 42 is the call with 42, after
; OPTIMIZE 16 (new syntax off) it is the call without parameters and
; 42 is left in the line - "Garbage at End of Line" in line 11
Macro pm
NPrint "<`1>"
End Macro
OPTIMIZE 4
!pm 42
OPTIMIZE 16
!pm 42
End
